# The tools the release workflows build and upload with. They run in the jobs that
# make and publish the release, so requirements-build.txt pins them and everything
# they depend on to one version and to the hashes PyPI lists, for all five build
# platforms. After changing this file, run the command at the top of that file. Add
# --upgrade to it to move every pin to the newest version.
build
